  "description": "Bring refreshing tropical refreshment, vibrant beverage aesthetics, and soft botanical charm to your creative projects with this gorgeous Summer Drinks Clipart Bundle! This hand-painted watercolor collection features 20 high-resolution PNG illustrations showcasing delightful summer and drink elements—including fruit-infused cocktails, ice buckets, lemonade pitchers, tropical fruit accents, floral wreaths, and charming country arrangements.\nPerfect for summer crafts, pool party junk journals, scrapbooking, sublimation designs, print-on-demand products, stickers, and rustic home decor!\nWhat’s Included:\n20 Individual PNG Files with transparent backgrounds\nHigh Resolution: 300 DPI for crisp, high-definition printing\nClean cutouts suitable for layering on light, dark, or textured backdrops\nIdeal Use Cases:\nPrint-On-Demand (POD): Summer drink t-shirts, botanical tote bags, aprons, cocktail coffee mugs, tumbler wraps, and throw pillows\nCrafting & DIY: Cricut/Silhouette print & cut projects, junk journals, scrapbooking, summer beverage stickers, and planner layouts\nStationery & Decor: Pool party invitations, greeting cards, gift tag stickers, wall art prints, and bookmark designs",
